{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：22:00 2026-08-29 HKT</p>\n\n<p>2016年港姐冠軍馮盈盈近日在社交平台上載了一段火辣十足的拍攝花絮短片，大晒健美身材，片中她穿上寶藍色貼身運動內衣，豐滿上圍呼之欲出。最震撼眼球的莫過於她下身穿著闊腳牛仔褲，而褲頭鈕扣與拉鏈完全解開，露出同色系內褲。鏡頭下，馮盈盈的腹部零贅肉，而且有結實腹肌，線條清晰分明。她時而斜靠在椅子上，大方挺腰放電，時而坐在地上回眸凝視，舉手投足間皆散發著自信美。</p>\n<h2>馮盈盈分享管理身材哲學</h2>\n<p>馮盈盈幾經努力才操出魔鬼身材，她在貼文中分享自己的身材管理哲學，寫道：「努力奮鬥，但要像真正的老闆一樣對待你的身體。照顧它，給它正確的營養、訓練、休息。不要跳過，不要找藉口。」這番自律言論配上噴血身材，隨即引來大批網民瘋狂點讚洗版，紛紛留言大讚：「狀態勁過十年前」、「哇，fyy女神呢副body，邊有得輸啊，完美無瑕咪就係咁」，驚嘆她無論身形或氣場都重回全盛顛峰。</p>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈早前分享自己做GYM的成果，大晒結實腹肌及人魚線。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/98495db57e3983a4f6819f068bd4ccac/2026-05/1_14.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈大晒火辣身材，俘虜不少粉絲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e5e89e724c829ae949fe7d2516711df4/2026-04/3550434849679162962_233098729.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈身材非常好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/38cc1aa0d6754842f49e3eb00dcf704a/2025-07/crystalfyy_1752837788_3679392505235283783_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈為自己澄清「冇走樣」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/847c7ef6ff619fb34c1cdaf7cf07a813/2025-07/crystalfyy_1752837788_3679392505243851751_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈大晒美背。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dd447a9fec8e29acab963305412f9cac/2025-07/crystalfyy_1752837788_3679392505302565339_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈有好多時間去旅遊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9f6150c0eeeee963ae065e94bf27ae2b/2025-07/crystalfyy_1752837788_3679392505520521374_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈分享水著靚相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b36b7885ec528e71c21562a2902786fd/2025-07/crystalfyy_1752837788_3679392505562565759_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈近年在晒身材方面非常大方。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/45fbd91eccac60e7395330af5edc2e32/2025-07/crystalfyy_1752837788_3679392505520545710_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈身材極火辣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ba88e48031a26fe6bb94d6852331a190/2025-10/6_4_15.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"網民指馮盈盈忽然撞樣張員瑛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1bff8aed83cea37376b82e551160e420/2025-10/7_4_20.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈上載多張性感泳照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/24aae2a43e141bc422e5bac002d7fcf9/2026-02/4_11_9.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈大派福利。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8e278c5568faa34bb5571fa1e9d69a94/2026-02/5_9_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈雙臂展開，完美展現出玲瓏有致的S形曲線，火辣身材一覽無遺。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8cb0741f968cfebf21a08eb5857d44b2/2026-02/6_8_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈浸在只有攝氏2度的冰水中，大方展示其驕人上圍和白滑肌膚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/80498b34e2e82b32e7dc36c0e72bd8ba/2026-02/7_7_7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"從高角度欣賞，馮盈盈在木桶中享受冰水療程，畫面極度吸睛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f614efeb6f6437a0cb7cfadcaf3fba89/2026-02/8_8_3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈在公園進行戶外瑜伽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/97134d947da1ddf731e5f3c4deee79b2/2026-02/9_8_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈工作量大減。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0197cbdae42a63fc404c8ef4950ad2a8/2025-07/crystalfyy_1752837788_3679390631581159596_233098729_mp4_snapshot_00_12_648.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈近年曾停工專注學業。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/97edb91c4d9c009da4c2b705391b1741/2025-07/crystalfyy_1752837788_3679390631581159596_233098729_mp4_snapshot_00_13_830.jpg\"/>\n<h2>馮盈盈減產重返校園完成碩士</h2>\n<p>事實上，馮盈盈近年努力保持體態，事業亦成功開拓全新版圖。自從贏得港姐冠軍入行後，她一度備受TVB力捧，參演過《果欄中的江湖大嫂》及《反黑路人甲》等重頭劇，惟2022年起幕前演出稍為減少。面對事業步入短暫沉靜期，她毅然重返校園，在香港大學攻讀食品產業管理市場營銷及管理學碩士，最終更以一級榮譽優異成績畢業，成功洗去過往「MK港姐」形象，蛻變為知性「學霸女神」。</p>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈早前分享多張靚相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c2cbf437a5ad4210dd2459670c180e71/2025-07/crystalfyy_1752145637_3673586326416397453_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈的天使造型。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/389a398d1b1f5321628c1c7688b80408/2025-07/crystalfyy_1752145637_3673586326424852355_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有網民將這輯照片與她與樂易玲的合照作對比。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/17d621a159207cb93305987df9f9bdbf/2025-07/crystalfyy_1752145637_3673586326550724610_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈有仙氣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2e7d31607e9d6ee3dce9c12f131372ab/2025-07/crystalfyy_1752145637_3673586326450187267_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈的造型獲盛讚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/436f30065a2fd1a41babb47b970fc9f0/2025-07/crystalfyy_1752145637_3673586326550747796_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈早前分享多張靚相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4d44c38be09e970231ff435f16a51b93/2025-07/crystalfyy_1752145637_3673586326710230761_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈近年越來越靚，打扮仙氣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1e214b62193fa329646788f4e46b98cc/2024-11/crystalfyy_459913691_18459910978010730_8805719530961411205_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈笑言自己是史上穿最多衫的內衣廣告。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9ccb5b0f19407ccd8527849b858ba39e/2025-12/crystalfyy_1766030422_3790060344891851990_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈澄清與TVB還有合約，表示大家可繼續找她開工。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/508fc2324e9c90669bc9e304ce1cb869/2025-12/crystalfyy_1766030422_3790060345026030853_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈近日再有「升CUP」內衣照流出。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0795dd9ed0781dc5b6b364e046f9d840/2025-12/crystalfyy_1766030422_3790060345026036789_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈笑言內衣廣告已是極限。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d6fc00276537044d98f862306ae77c0a/2025-12/crystalfyy_1766030422_3790060345177033370_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈表示最重要是身材勻稱，展露曲線已很迷人，不會用其他手法造假。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/13eb1233e0bf9643c7aba2b170256f56/2025-12/crystalfyy_1766030422_3790060345185430890_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈的新一輯內衣照，再次震撼網民眼球。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e98af0680a1bd5b01b90b886f7fdf68e/2025-12/crystalfyy_1766030422_3790060345185447935_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈再有噴血級內衣靚相流出。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6547e72eea52e0410e8f49fc4d9ef484/2025-12/crystalfyy_1765858698_3788619812676199432_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈展示出穿上內衣的不同效果。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f373c99924bceccb96c88d44cf0f706e/2025-11/crystalfyy_1763352905_3767599701328853685_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈大騷深長事業線。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/06ea7b4b1af9b2bebd5068c5f4110460/2025-11/crystalfyy_1763352905_3767599701337243426_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈拍攝這輯內衣廣告靚相，獲網民激讚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9a1ae8a3fefa5189a1a8822aea00ebba/2025-11/crystalfyy_1763352905_3767599701446292832_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈穿上這套較為簡約的內衣時，上圍即時連跳幾Cup，看得網民嘩嘩聲！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0d9850e8db55aa5dbe8422d0818f1618/2025-11/crystalfyy_1763352905_3767599701454654060_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈的內衣廣告相，網民大讚超級sexy。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/18565293277d29b8065133a81712a6c6/2025-11/crystalfyy_1763352905_3767599701614043668_233098729.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"馮盈盈獲得內衣品牌品牌青睞，邀請拍攝廣告。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2bf2c80a19b8157cb93d23eff875bf0a/2025-11/crystalfyy_1763352905_3767599701714707796_233098729.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-29T14:18:32.669828+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":593,"images":38,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}